openh4
======

An open reimplementation of the Heroes of Might and Magic IV engine.

This repository holds the engine and its programs only. No game data is
included: you need your own copy of Heroes of Might and Magic IV from GOG.
On first start, openh4 can use an installer you already downloaded or sign
in to GOG and fetch it for you.

The project is unfinished.


Building
--------

Requirements: CMake 3.28 or newer, Ninja, a C++23 compiler, zlib, liblzma
and SDL3. Without SDL3 only the engine libraries and h4-tool are built.

    cmake --preset release
    cmake --build --preset release

Other presets (dev, debug, asan, tsan, xcode-macos, xcode-ios) are listed
in CMakePresets.json.


Layout
------

    src/h4/       the engine, one static library per module
    apps/openh4/  the game
    apps/h4-tool/ command-line tool for inspecting and rendering game data


